						"content": "这份设计方案专为 **小红书（Xiaohongshu）** 平台定制，核心策略是 **「轻量化信息 + 强视觉冲击 + 情绪价值」**。我们将原本枯燥的详情页转化为类似潮流杂志（Zine）的排版。\n\n整体视觉基调：\n*   **风格：** Urban Techwear / 酸性设计（Acid Graphics） / 极简工业风\n*   **配色：** 酷灰背景（Cool Grey）+ 极致黑（产品）+ **酸性绿（Acid Green）** 作为高亮文字/装饰点缀。\n*   **尺寸：** 750:1000 (竖屏)\n\n以下是5张详情页的结构化设计与AI提示词拆解：\n\n---\n\n### Page 1: 封面海报 (The Hook)\n**设计意图：** 停止划动，利用模特带雪镜的酷感，建立“机能潮人”的第一印象。\n*   **排版布局：** 杂志封面式排版。模特图片铺满或占据80%版面，品牌Logo放大置于顶部或作为背景纹理。\n*   **视觉元素：** 模特全身照（带雪镜），背景叠加十字准星、经纬度线条，营造精密装备感。\n*   **文案信息：**\n    *   主标题：**RATATA / 无界探索** (大号字体)\n    *   副标题：URBAN OUTDOOR SERIES\n    *   标签：#机能背带裤 #雪季装备 #OOTD\n*   **设计细节：** 标题字使用粗体无衬线字，颜色使用白色，带有酸性绿的下划线。\n\n> **AI绘画提示词 (Prompt):**\n> **[Page 1 Design]**: An e-commerce poster design for a mobile screen, aspect ratio 3:4. **Subject**: A cool Asian male model wearing black snowboard overalls and ski goggles, posing casually with one hand adjusting the goggles. **Background**: Solid industrial grey background with subtle topographic map textures. **Typography**: Large, bold white sans-serif text at the top reads \"RATATA\", below it \"URBAN OUTDOOR\". **Details**: Add neon acid green graphic elements like crosshairs and tech-lines overlaying the image. High-end streetwear magazine cover style, minimalistic, 8k resolution, clean UI. --ar 3:4\n\n---\n\n### Page 2: 风格与场景 (The Vibe)\n**设计意图：** 强调“雪地”与“街头”的双重适用性，解决用户“只能滑雪穿吗？”的疑虑。\n*   **排版布局：** 上下分层结构。\n*   **视觉元素：** 上半部分保留模特上半身特写（突出白色卫衣内搭的干净感），下半部分使用色块分割，放入“雪山”和“街道”的黑白剪影图标。\n*   **文案信息：**\n    *   核心卖点：**雪场 / 街头 // 随意切换**\n    *   描述：宽松版型，内搭卫衣不臃肿。从城市漫游到雪地撒野，一条裤子搞定。\n    *   装饰字：CITY / SNOW\n*   **设计细节：** 文字排版采用左对齐，配合类似“代码块”的排版装饰。\n\n> **AI绘画提示词 (Prompt):**\n> **[Page 2 Design]**: Mobile UI design for a fashion product detail page, aspect ratio 3:4. **Layout**: Split composition. Top half shows a close-up of the black overalls chest area and white hoodie texture, high contrast lighting. Bottom half is a clean layout block in dark grey. **Graphics**: Minimalist icons representing a \"Snow Mountain\" and a \"City Skyline\" in acid green neon lines. **Text**: Bold Chinese typography \"雪场 / 街头\" (Snow/Street) and \"随意切换\" (Switch Freely). **Style**: Techwear aesthetic, clean lines, information visualization, futuristic vibe. --ar 3:4\n\n---\n\n### Page 3: 机能细节解析 (The Tech)\n**设计意图：** 利用平铺图展示硬核功能，通过局部放大体现做工。\n*   **排版布局：** 居中展示产品的正面平铺图（去除背景），四周通过“引线（Callout lines）”指向具体细节。\n*   **视觉元素：** 黑色背带裤正面平铺图。引线指向：侧边口袋、卡扣、裤脚。每个引线末端有圆形的放大镜效果图。\n*   **文案信息：**\n    *   标题：**硬核机能解析**\n    *   引线1：多功能立体口袋 (Multi-pockets)\n    *   引线2：定制树脂卡扣 (Resin Buckle)\n    *   引线3：立体剪裁裤脚 (3D Cut)\n*   **设计细节：** 引线使用高亮的酸性绿色，背景为深灰色的网格纸（Grid Paper）纹理。\n\n> **AI绘画提示词 (Prompt):**\n> **[Page 3 Design]**: Product feature breakdown graphic, mobile format, aspect ratio 3:4. **Center Subject**: Flat lay of black technical overalls isolated on a dark grey technical grid background. **Graphics**: Bright acid green callout lines pointing to specific parts of the pants (pockets, buckles, hem). At the end of each line, a circular zoom-in bubble showing fabric texture. **Text**: Technical font in white and green, labeling features like \"POCKETS\", \"BUCKLE\", \"FABRIC\". **Style**: Industrial design blueprint, schematic look, high contrast, professional gear presentation. --ar 3:4\n\n---\n\n### Page 4: 背面与结构 (The Structure)\n**设计意图：** 展示背带系统的美感，机能风的背带设计通常是亮点。\n*   **排版布局：** 极简留白。\n*   **视觉元素：** 背面平铺图居中。背景使用巨大的、半透明的RATATA Logo（三角形松树标志）作为底纹。\n*   **文案信息：**\n    *   标题：**背部工装系统**\n    *   描述：可调节背带，舒适不掉肩。高腰护腰设计，防风防雪。\n    *   英文装饰：ADJUSTABLE SYSTEM // HIGH PERFORMANCE\n*   **设计细节：** 强调黑色的深邃感，光影要打出面料的质感（稍微有点反光的感觉）。\n\n> **AI绘画提示词 (Prompt):**\n> **[Page 4 Design]**: Minimalist fashion product page, mobile format, aspect ratio 3:4. **Subject**: Flat lay of the *back side* of black snowboard overalls. **Background**: A very light grey background with a giant, semi-transparent watermark of a triangular pine tree logo. **Text**: Clean, Swiss-style typography in black and grey, describing \"ADJUSTABLE SYSTEM\". **Lighting**: Studio lighting highlighting the texture of the straps and the back panel. **Vibe**: Premium, understated luxury, structural beauty. --ar 3:4\n\n---\n\n### Page 5: 尺码与导购 (The Guide)\n**设计意图：** 消除购买顾虑，临门一脚促成转化。\n*   **排版布局：** 数据可视化表格。\n*   **视觉元素：** 页面上方放置模特全身小图作为参考。下方是黑底白字的尺码矩阵表。\n*   **文案信息：**\n    *   标题：**选码指南 / SIZE GUIDE**\n    *   模特参数框：身高180cm / 体重65kg / 试穿L码 (宽松)\n    *   表格列：尺码 (M/L/XL) - 裤长 - 腰围 - 臀围\n    *   底部CTA按钮：**[ 点击购买 探索雪域 ]** (模拟按钮样式，酸性绿填充，黑色文字)\n*   **设计细节：** 表格不要用传统的Excel线条，用断开的线段或“+”号作为交叉点，保持机能感。\n\n> **AI绘画提示词 (Prompt):**\n> **[Page 5 Design]**: Size guide interface design for mobile e-commerce, aspect ratio 3:4. **Top**: Small thumbnail of the model wearing the pants. **Main**: A futuristic, data-visualization style size chart on a black background. Numbers are in a monospace digital font (white). **Bottom**: A prominent call-to-action button in neon acid green with bold black text \"SHOP NOW\". **Details**: Tech-interface elements, loading bars, battery icons decoration. **Style**: Cyberpunk UI, user-friendly but edgy, high clarity. --ar 3:4"
